              "message": "Fix: Splash Screen / Help menu - Update bforartists.de links to bforartists.co #7019 (#7021)\n\nThe old bforartists.de URLs now land on 404 pages after the move to\nbforartists.co. Pointed the splash Getting Started links and the Help\nmenu at the new pages: manual -> docs/home, release notes ->\nsupport/release-notes, credits -> about/people, website -> root.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
