              "message": "Fix: General - Update remaining bforartists.de URLs #7022 (#7023)\n\nSweep of the bforartists.de leftovers outside the splash and Help menu\n(#7019). The old domain's content paths don't exist on bforartists.co,\nso each entry got its real target rather than a domain swap:\n\n- Add-on doc links now point at the matching docs/ pages on the new site\n- Issue-template forum link -> community/overview\n- AppStream homepage -> bforartists.co; its two dead wp-content\n  screenshots -> UI shots hosted in the Bforartists/Manual repo\n- readme.html build tutorial link -> the project wiki; webpage -> .co\n- COPYING and the Important Hotkeys header comment -> bforartists.co\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
