              "message": "Fix: Video Sequencer > Text Strip > Style - Labels misaligned by one row below Line Spacing #6939 (#7014)\n\nThe absolute line spacing toggle sat on its own row in the value column, so every label below Line Spacing ended up one row away from its field. It now shares the Line Spacing row like in Blender, and the field drops its duplicated 'Line Spacing' text since the label column already shows it. Fixes both Properties > Strip and the Sidebar, which reuses the same draw.",
